  "reflectionText": "Malachi said: the Lord is like a refiner's fire and like launderer's soap. He will sit as a refiner and purifier of silver. He will purify the sons of Levi as gold and silver. Have you ever been the silver in the refiner's hand, kept in the fire until he can see himself reflected in the metal?"
